  - Egyptian Government Officials rarely visit Provo, Utah. I]
  (grok_render_citation_card_jsı

  - SU-BND is owned and operated by the Egyptian Government, serial number 1332,
  primarily i

  - SU-BND came online on the tarmac at Provo/PVU 21 minutes before Charlie Kirk
  was shot.

  - SU-BND hung out at PVU until 1 hour after the shooting, then transponder
  turned off, no

  - SU-BND came back online on September 13th and flew to Goosebay Canada, then
  Paris & Cai

  - There were two Egyptian military planes near UVU on September 10, 2025:
  SU-BTT and SU-BI

  - SU-BND arrived in Provo, UT on 09/05/25 and left after the assassination on
  09/13/25. [

  - SU-BND had a search query from Israel two days before Charlie Kirk's
  assassination. [](!

  - SU-BND landed in Provo on September 5, 2025, and left on September 13, 2025.
